flowchart TD
    O((O)) --> Access{Secretary authorized?}
    Access -- No --> Denied[Access Restricted]
    Access -- Yes --> Archive[Open private Ordinance Archive]
    Archive --> Filter[Search and filter by title, category, status, year]
    Filter --> Action{Choose action}

    Action -- Create or edit --> Metadata[Enter ordinance number, title, category,
    enacted date, summary, sponsor, status]
    Metadata --> File{Signed PDF available?}
    File -- Yes --> Upload[Upload signed PDF to ordinance-pdfs]
    File -- No --> Generated[Generate official preview document]
    Upload --> Save[Save ordinance metadata]
    Generated --> Save

    Action -- Preview --> Preview[Open generated or uploaded document preview]
    Action -- Print --> Print[Print document]
    Action -- Download --> Download[Download PDF]
    Action -- Hide or show --> Toggle[Update is_active]
    Action -- Delete --> Delete[Remove ordinance and file]

    Save --> R((R: Dashboard))
    Preview --> R
    Print --> R
    Download --> R
    Toggle --> R
    Delete --> R
